392
00:20:00,700 --> 00:20:05,520
You know, again, you know, this is another example. You know, the market is starting to move up.

393
00:20:05,540 --> 00:20:08,260
And you're seeing it happen on strong buying.

394
00:20:08,920 --> 00:20:13,760
You know, buying imbalance of 1,200, getting volume of 2,100, 2,400.

395
00:20:14,020 --> 00:20:15,080
