00:20:20,580 --> 00:20:22,800
You know, 600 against 2.

399
00:20:22,800 --> 00:20:26,320
So, you know, it's strong buying on the way back up.

400
00:20:31,560 --> 00:20:32,480
This is a different price.

401
00:20:32,480 --> 00:20:33,780
This is crude, you know.

402
00:20:33,960 --> 00:20:36,700
And what you're seeing is you're seeing volume up here.

403
00:20:36,800 --> 00:20:39,020
You know, it's to stop it, stop the move higher.

404
00:20:39,200 --> 00:20:40,100
It's the same price.

405
00:20:40,180 --> 00:20:41,220
People are trying to take it higher.

406
00:20:41,220 --> 00:20:42,470
But there's somebody up here,

407
00:20:42,470 --> 00:20:43,720
you know, at this price

408
00:20:43,720 --> 00:20:47,220
here that has volume. They don't want the market to get past that level.

409
00:20:48,140 --> 00:20:49,336
I mean, they may let

410
00:20:49,336 --> 00:20:50,532
it go past by a

411
00:20:50,532 --> 00:20:51,728
tick or two. But, you

412
00:20:51,728 --> 00:20:54,838
know, there's somebody that has a lot of inventory to sell up here.

413
00:20:55,520 --> 00:21:01,040
And, you know, water flows is, you know, the only way you can determine that.

414
00:21:01,040 --> 00:21:08,660
You know, this is a five-year chart, right?

415
00:21:08,720 --> 00:21:11,560
And you're seeing a nice move up from a low.

416
00:21:11,740 --> 00:21:13,313
And you're seeing massive

