00:21:21,440 --> 00:21:25,300
You're seeing, you know, these massive imbalances, 5,000, 5,000, 4,000.

421
00:21:25,300 --> 00:21:30,200
And, you know, big positive deltas as the market is moving away from the low.

422
00:21:30,860 --> 00:21:32,220
You know, you see right

