00:22:04,620 --> 00:22:07,480
You've got a couple of imbalances, you know, but it turns right up here.

433
00:22:08,180 --> 00:22:13,060
And, you know, what happens in the delta is very strong, negative, you know, at the end of a move.

434
00:22:13,240 --> 00:22:14,991
You know, you have the

435
00:22:14,991 --> 00:22:17,443
market moved up, kind of moved up

