00:23:25,522 --> 00:23:27,093
I said, there's all sorts of different

459
00:23:27,093 --> 00:23:30,459
market participants. But, you know, you want to understand why they're doing what they're doing.

460
00:23:30,460 --> 00:23:32,435
You know, it's one thing

